	(text "BUS INTERFACE, PORT DECODE, CONTROL AND STATUS (PA-PE)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2919247c-1d36-5158-9d3e-4e86c42bad8b"))
	(text "X1: the YACC1 V3.2 bus (DIN 41612). IC30 decodes IO-ADDR0-3: Y2..Y7 = ports PA..PF when IO-ADDR3 = 1.\nIC31 / IC32 gate the strobes: PC write = control register IC33 (cleared by -RESET), PC read = status IC34\n(DOTS, VSYNC, DE, TEXT-ONLY, card ID 0101), PD write / read = the PS/2 command latch / status, PE read = PS/2 data." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "77b362a3-5f53-586b-a887-93e39a1f506f"))
